--- !u!114 &6124249128449942710
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7658137184552655675}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ee71bae2b2ea2d4386dce41c6feac80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialoguebox
  DialogueSegments:
  - Dialogue: '     < You start to greet the stranger, but before you can speak,
      they cut you off >'
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a47631f9fe0cece4ab84178e5649e0ae, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: " I know what you want. Here, I\u2019ll save myself having to hear
      your pitiful cries. \u201CPlease, good stranger! Might you point me into the
      direction of that Sacred Tower, that I might leave this mortal plane and enter
      the next stage of life!\u201D or some other pathetic story. "
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "Well, you\u2019re not getting past here, for your own good. And the
      path around the mountain range is a hell of a long one. But surely if you\u2019re
      so intent on leaving the world behind, that won\u2019t be an issue for you,
      right?"
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: '< One eye glares at you from behind the blindfold, expectantly. > '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a47631f9fe0cece4ab84178e5649e0ae, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "Can\u2019t you help me remove the blockade?"
      NextSegmentIndex: 4
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: And this is for my own good.. How?
      NextSegmentIndex: 7
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: What's your name?
      NextSegmentIndex: 12
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: "Help you remove it? Ha! Who do you think built the thing? What, didn\u2019t
      expect people to still be building stuff? I\u2019m one of the lucky few who
      still gets to use their hands, and one of the fewer who choose to do so.  "
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: You built this all on your own?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "There used to be more of us, but one by one that damned tower took
      them all. Its not natural. That thing calls to everyone. You don\u2019t look
      like you\u2019re from even remotely close to here, and yet here you are, looking
      for \u201Csalvation.\u201D"
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: And this is for my own good.. How?
      NextSegmentIndex: 7
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: What's your name?
      NextSegmentIndex: 12
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: 'That place messes with your mind. I''ve lost good people to it. A
      long time ago.. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "Look, even I'm not proud of this, but a long time ago.. Me and a good
      friend of mine climbed the tower, and slew one of the whales. A juvenile. We
      wanted to.. I don't know, send a message? Prove that these beings weren\u2019t
      the immortal celestial beings people were worshipping them for."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "When we succeeded, I wanted to leave as quickly as possible. I've
      seen what happens to people who stay too long, I'm sure you've seen it too.
      But my friend, he.. froze. Then turned to me with this glassy expression in
      his eyes. And said, \u201CI can't live with this, forgive me.\u201D And then
      walked backwards into the fog."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: ...
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: He  left me behind. Left everyone behind. Don't do the same.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c11521e10e6272243b724d43641a7f60, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "Can\u2019t you help me remove the blockade?"
      NextSegmentIndex: 4
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: What's your name?
      NextSegmentIndex: 12
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: It's Fedalla. Surprised you care. What's yours?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: I don't know, I never got one. I didn't know people valued them so
      much until I left my hometown.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: My name comes from the priest's holy book. But it's the name of someone
      who supposedly hunted the whales. It tells you a lot about the kind of people
      my parents were.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: 'The fact you don''t have a name holds value too. It tells me enough
      about where you came from to understand why you want to do this. But i''m still
      telling you, don''t. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "Can\u2019t you help me remove the blockade?"
      NextSegmentIndex: 16
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: And this is for my own good.. How?
      NextSegmentIndex: 19
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: 24
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: "Help you remove it? Ha! Who do you think built the thing? What, didn\u2019t
      expect people to still be building stuff? I\u2019m one of the lucky few who
      still gets to use their hands, and one of the fewer who choose to do so.  "
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: You built this all on your own?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "There used to be more of us, but one by one that damned tower took
      them all. Its not natural. That thing calls to everyone. You don\u2019t look
      like you\u2019re from even remotely close to here, and yet here you are, looking
      for \u201Csalvation.\u201D"
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: And this is for my own good.. How?
      NextSegmentIndex: 18
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: 24
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: 'That place messes with your mind. I''ve lost good people to it. A
      long time ago.. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "Look, even I'm not proud of this, but a long time ago, me and a good
      friend of mine climbed the tower, and slew one of the whales. A juvenile. We
      wanted to.. I don't know, send a message? Prove that these beings weren\u2019t
      the immortal celestial beings people were worshipping them for."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "When we succeeded, I wanted to leave as quickly as possible. I've
      seen what happens to people who stay too long, I'm sure you've seen it too.
      But my friend, he.. froze. Then turned to me with this glassy expression in
