      walked backwards into the fog."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: ...
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: He left me behind. Left everyone behind. Don't do the same.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Can't you help me remove the blockade?
      NextSegmentIndex: 16
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: 24
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: Goodbye, nameless face. I hope you find purpose. It's worth more than
      death.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 882046508db9c72409d435f4b5d56157, type: 2}
